nning studio<br> trusted by leading brands.</p><div class=\"lp-clients-wrapper\"><div class=\"lp-clients-scroll\"><div class=\"lp-clients__track\"><div class=\"lp-clients__group\"><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/jr.svg\" alt=\"JR\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"50\" height=\"36\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/lv.svg\" alt=\"Louis Vuitton\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"36\" height=\"35\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/kia.svg\" alt=\"Kia\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"24\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/league-of-legends.svg\" alt=\"League of Legends\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"90\" height=\"34\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/bmw.svg\" alt=\"BMW\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/warner.svg\" alt=\"Warner\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"107\" height=\"34\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/smrj.svg\" alt=\"SMRJ\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"74\" height=\"41\"></div></div><div class=\"lp-clients__group\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/jr.svg\" alt=\"JR\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"50\" height=\"36\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/lv.svg\" alt=\"Louis Vuitton\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"36\" height=\"35\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/kia.svg\" alt=\"Kia\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"24\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/league-of-legends.svg\" alt=\"League of Legends\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"90\" height=\"34\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/bmw.svg\" alt=\"BMW\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/warner.svg\" alt=\"Warner\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"107\" height=\"34\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/smrj.svg\" alt=\"SMRJ\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"74\" height=\"41\"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"lp-highlight\"><p class=\"lp-highlight__text client-ee-highlight\">People pay for memories, <span class='down'>not things.</span><br> We craft interactive experiences that turn visits into stories<span class='down'>—photos, reels, and repeat trips.</span></p></section><section class=\"lp-benefits flx-center\"><div class=\"lp-benefits__grid\"><div class=\"lp-benefits__item\"><h2 class=\"lp-benefits__title\">Monetize the Moment</h2><p class=\"lp-benefits__text\">Longer dwell times, higher ticket tiers, and more on-site spend.</p></div><div class=\"lp-benefits__item\"><h2 class=\"lp-benefits__title\">Automated Marketing</h2><p class=\"lp-benefits__text\">Installations designed for UGC—so guests promote you with their own photos and reels.</p></div><div class=\"lp-benefits__item\"><h2 class=\"lp-benefits__title\">Dynamic &amp; Repeatable</h2><p class=\"lp-benefits__text\">Signature experiences guests come back for, and talk about long after they leave.</p></div><div class=\"lp-benefits__item\"><h2 class=\"lp-benefits__title\">Compete on Experience</h2><p class=\"lp-benefits__text\">Give people a clear reason to choose your venue.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"lp-what\"><div class=\"lp-what__wrap\"><div class=\"lp-portrait with-gradient\"><img src=\"/_astro/what-we-make.BhPPKX2U_1mXSn.webp\" srcset=\"/_astro/what-we-make.BhPPKX2U_dCKD0.webp 360w, /_astro/what-we-make.BhPPKX2U_yUXgl.webp 619w\" alt=\"Installation photo\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 60px), (max-width: 920px) calc(100vw - 100px), (max-width: 1280px) 575px, 685px\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" width=\"620\" height=\"718\"></div><div class=\"lp-what__body flx-column\"><div class=\"lp-title  align-left\"><h2 class=\"lp-title__main \">What we make</h2><p class=\"lp-title__sub wwm-sub\">From lobby centerpieces to full-scale immersive rooms.</p></div><ol class=\"lp-numlist flx-column\"><li class=\"lp-numlist-item\"><span class=\"lp-what__index\">01.</span><span class=\"lp-what__text\">Digital Art</span></li><li class=\"lp-numlist-item\"><span class=\"lp-what__index\">02.</span><span class=\"lp-what__text\">Interactive Installations</span></li><li class=\"lp-numlist-item\"><span class=\"lp-what__index\">03.</span><span class=\"lp-what__text\">Projection Mapping</span></li><li class=\"lp-numlist-item\"><span class=\"lp-what__index\">04.</span><span class=\"lp-what__text\">Sensor-driven / Generative Installations</span></li><li class=\"lp-numlist-item\"><span class=\"lp-what__index\">05.</span><span class=\"lp-what__text\">Data‑driven Brand Stories</span></li><li class=\"lp-numlist-item\"><span class=\"lp-what__index\">06.</span><span class=\"lp-what__text\">Gamified Experiences</span></li></ol></div></div></section><section class=\"lp-serve\"><div class=\"lp-serve-grid\"><div class=\"lp-serve-columns\"><div class=\"lp-serve-column\"><div class=\"lp-title lp-serve-title align-left\"><h2 class=\"lp-title__main \">Who we serve</h2></div><div class=\"info-card-item\"><div class=\"info-card-content\"><img class=\"info-card-card-icon\" src=\"/landing/experience-economy-interactive-installations/tourism.svg\" alt=\"Tourism &#38; Cities icon\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"info-card-text-wrapper\"><div class=\"info-card-texts\"><h3 class=\"info-card-card-title normal-font\">Tourism & Cities</h3><p class=\"info-card-card-text small-txt\">Shareable landmarks and seasons that grow visitor numbers and earned media.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"info-card-item\"><div class=\"info-card-content\"><img class=\"info-card-card-icon\" src=\"/landing/experience-economy-interactive-installations/workplaces.svg\" alt=\"Corporate HQ &#38; REITs icon\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"info-card-text-wrapper\"><div class=\"info-card-texts\"><h3 class=\"info-card-card-title normal-font\">Corporate HQ & REITs</h3><p class=\"info-card-card-text small-txt\">Attract top talent and tenants with lobbies that visualize company culture in real-time.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"lp-serve-column\"><div class=\"info-card-item\"><div class=\"info-card-content\"><img class=\"info-card-card-icon\" src=\"/landing/experience-economy-interactive-installations/hotels.svg\" alt=\"Hotels &#38; Hospitality icon\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"info-card-text-wrapper\"><div class=\"info-card-texts\"><h3 class=\"info-card-card-title normal-font\">Hotels & Hospitality</h3><p class=\"info-card-card-text small-txt\">Signature lobby and rooftop moments that drive bookings and F&B spend.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"info-card-item\"><div class=\"info-card-content\"><img class=\"info-card-card-icon\" src=\"/landing/experience-economy-interactive-installations/attractions.svg\" alt=\"Museums &#38; Attractions icon\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"info-card-text-wrapper\"><div class=\"info-card-texts\"><h3 class=\"info-card-card-title normal-font\">Museums & Attractions</h3><p class=\"info-card-card-text small-txt\">Move beyond static exhibits. Create immersive galleries that capture new audiences.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"info-card-item\"><div class=\"info-card-content\"><img class=\"info-card-card-icon\" src=\"/landing/experience-economy-interactive-installations/retails.svg\" alt=\"Retail &#38; Malls icon\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"info-card-text-wrapper\"><div class=\"info-card-texts\"><h3 class=\"info-card-card-title normal-font\">Retail & Malls</h3><p class=\"info-card-card-text small-txt\">Combat declining footfall. Create \"phygital\" zones that extend dwell time and lift basket sizes.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"lp-stats flx-col-center\"><p class=\"lp-stats__lead lp-highlight__text\">67% of visitors will pay extra for unique, memorable experiences.<br> Interactive installations are how you stage them.</p><a href=\"https://www.lt.agency/industries/attractions-marketing-agency/iaapa-leisure-consumer-trends-report-2023\" class=\"lp-stats__sub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Source: 2024 Leisure Consumer Trends Report </a></section><section id=\"faqs\" class=\"lp-faq flx-column\"><div class=\"lp-title  align-left\"><h2 class=\"lp-title__main \">FAQs</h2></div><div class=\"lp-faq__list\"><div class=\"lp-faq__item open\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"true\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>Can installations be refreshed?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: none;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>Absolutely. We design systems for seasonal content drops and live data feeds so it stays fresh without rebuilding hardware.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">−</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>What is the typical investment?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>Projects typically range from $40k to $250k+ USD. This varies based on hardware specs (projectors/LED), square footage, and content complexity.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>What is the timeline?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>Fast-track installations can be ready in 6–8 weeks. Complex, multi-sensory architectural integrations typically require 12–16 weeks.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>Do you work with US/Global clients?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>Yes. We are a global team. We handle remote design and software development, and partner with local AV integrators in the US, EU, and Asia for on-site hardware installation.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>How do we start?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p><a href=\"https://www.kiasa.tech/source_url=%2Fexperience-economy-interactive-installations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Book a 15-min concept call</a>. Share your floor plan/photos, target guest, and timeline—we'll return concept options and a budgetary estimate.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div></div></section><section class=\"lp-contact flx-center\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef><div class=\"lp-contact-card bg-card\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef><div class=\"lp-contact-mc flx\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef><div class=\"lp-contact__head\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef><div class=\"lp-title  align-left\"><h2 class=\"lp-title__main small\">Let's design your<br> next signature moment.</h2><p class=\"lp-title__sub \">Take the first step into the experience economy.</p></div></div><form class=\"lp-form\" id=\"contact-form\" action=\"/api/contact\" method=\"post\" 